msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:17
#: aed178ad15f14f99acd78f9ca9fa1afb
msgid ""
"This page assumes that you've successfully followed the ROS 2 basic setups "
"from this wiki: :ref:`ROS 2 <ros2>`, :ref:`ROS 2 with SITL <ros2-sitl>`, and"
" :ref:`ROS 2 with gazebo <ros2-gazebo>`."
msgstr ""
"本页假设您已成功完成本 wiki 中的 ROS 2 基础配置：:ref:`ROS 2 <ros2>`、:ref:`ROS 2 与 SITL "
"<ros2-sitl>` 以及 :ref:`ROS 2 与 Gazebo <ros2-gazebo>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:19
#: 56b294a79ca440e592e3ccebf292c467
msgid "Once that's done, start the MicroROS Agent."
msgstr "完成上述配置后，启动 MicroROS Agent。"

