msgstr "**解锁飞机**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:55
#: 810c79809f384ae2a75dbdc4235117f6
msgid "Run the following command to arm the motors:"
msgstr "运行以下命令解锁电机："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:66
#: 24faa2e2d92a42b6ad3dab01f492f179
msgid "**Switching to Takeoff Mode**:"
msgstr "**切换到起飞模式**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:62
#: 227ed52382a64e1d957464ac7b63eb08
msgid "Change the flight mode to takeoff:"
msgstr "将飞行模式切换为起飞模式："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:75
#: f05a7e1ea88846658e2a99169ece194a
msgid "**Reaching Takeoff Altitude**:"
msgstr "**到达起飞高度**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:69
#: 52647df2c34244c5bbf2385f07bbb61e
msgid ""
"Wait until the plane reaches the takeoff altitude. You can monitor the "
"altitude using:"
msgstr "等待飞机到达起飞高度。可通过以下命令监控高度："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:75
#: ae9acc01f30f4c659e3f3d1f78e91715
msgid ""
"Ensure the plane's altitude reaches the desired level (e.g., 630 meters "
"AGL)."
msgstr "确保飞机高度达到所需高度（例如，海拔高度 630 米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:82
#: 744ddb6e398f4098b5beddeb975abdf8
msgid "**Switching to Guided Mode**:"
msgstr "**切换到引导模式**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:78
#: 7b712fd26d104b2eaf0776749421bd6a
msgid "Once the takeoff altitude is reached, switch to guided mode:"
msgstr "到达起飞高度后，切换到引导模式："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:89
#: 42f6c5f9cf9a4114a68bd3253a71766a
msgid "**Sending Waypoint Command**:"
msgstr "**发送航点命令**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:85
#: 64c16619072d407b96ceb886e58f0b56
msgid "Publish the goal position to guide the plane to the desired waypoint:"
msgstr "发布目标位置，引导飞机前往目标航点："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:92
#: 1cb2d26d6f634d06b29a44f7b074ad6e
msgid "Using ROS2 Node"
msgstr "使用 ROS 2 节点"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:101
#: 9e2f3a19ffaf4495980cd10f4c9261cb
msgid "Understanding the ROS 2 Node"
msgstr "理解 ROS 2 节点"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:103
#: ac6ca882c50b42a082bedfce2d198403
msgid ""
"Here's a detailed explanation of how this `ROS2 Node works "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/ros2/ardupilot_dds_tests/ardupilot_dds_tests/plane_waypoint_follower.py>`_:"
msgstr ""
"以下是对该 `ROS 2 节点工作原理 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/ros2/ardupilot_dds_tests/ardupilot_dds_tests/plane_waypoint_follower.py>`_"
" 的详细说明："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:106
#: f84ab6f860d64974b8aad3265d0eea76
msgid "**Initialization**:"
msgstr "**初始化**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:106
#: f1ad51ffda58471bb30c5a0f54303e23
msgid ""
"The node is initialized with `PlaneWaypointFollower(Node)`, which sets up "
"the necessary parameters and clients for communication with ArduPilot "
"services."
msgstr "节点通过 `PlaneWaypointFollower(Node)` 初始化，设置与 ArduPilot 服务通信所需的参数和客户端。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:110
#: 973b1f693aab4ce6972b779df1242f8e
msgid "**Service Clients**:"
msgstr "**服务客户端**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:109
#: 57af773f8bc941a4a84ad534362a8039
msgid ""
"`self._client_arm` and `self._client_mode_switch` are created to handle "
"arming the motors and switching flight modes, respectively."
msgstr "`self._client_arm` 和 `self._client_mode_switch` 分别用于处理解锁电机和切换飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:110
#: 8810b3dd341d4f9ebf624409f8329135
msgid ""
"These clients wait for the respective services to become available before "
"proceeding."
msgstr "这些客户端在继续操作之前会等待相应服务变为可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:114
#: 8e46057b27594bd4ad4290d6ea4d6240
msgid "**Publishers and Subscribers**:"
msgstr "**发布者与订阅者**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:113
#: 59d59283a7bd48998e2e8e7135211a98
msgid ""
"A publisher `self._global_pos_pub` is created to send global position "
"commands."
msgstr "创建发布者 `self._global_pos_pub` 用于发送全局位置命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:114
#: 1ebed3be27a7448584d09eb6fb685ce9
msgid ""
"A subscriber `self._subscription_geopose` listens for GeoPose messages to "
"update the current position of the plane."
msgstr "订阅者 `self._subscription_geopose` 监听 GeoPose 消息以更新飞机当前位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:117
#: 3bb157ed2e164e64bc5cbcdbec57933b
msgid "**Callback Function**:"
msgstr "**回调函数**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:117
#: ad61a00acdb5480ca6afb67d48c6a25c
msgid ""
"`geopose_cb(self, msg: GeoPoseStamped)` processes incoming GeoPose messages "
"and updates the current position."
msgstr "`geopose_cb(self, msg: GeoPoseStamped)` 处理传入的 GeoPose 消息并更新当前位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:122
#: 05b557f02a8e44cd8e6021c60e685e98
msgid "**Arming and Mode Switching Functions**:"
msgstr "**解锁与模式切换函数**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:120
#: 274a06e0cedb4b8693e72a19b844330a
msgid "`arm(self)` sends a request to arm the motors."
msgstr "`arm(self)` 发送解锁电机的请求。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:121
#: a3a80a3e3c9d4df79a373d24f56b76ab
msgid ""
"`switch_mode(self, mode)` sends a request to change the flight mode to "
"either takeoff or guided."
msgstr "`switch_mode(self, mode)` 发送将飞行模式切换为起飞或引导模式的请求。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:122
#: 7ee42539eaea4f1c9544bf50f6bba8b6
msgid ""
"`arm_with_timeout(self, timeout: rclpy.duration.Duration)` and "
"`switch_mode_with_timeout(self, desired_mode: int, timeout: "
"rclpy.duration.Duration)` try to arm and switch modes with a timeout."
msgstr ""
"`arm_with_timeout(self, timeout: rclpy.duration.Duration)` 和 "
"`switch_mode_with_timeout(self, desired_mode: int, timeout: "
"rclpy.duration.Duration)` 尝试在超时时间内完成解锁和模式切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:128
#: bbdde47a101c45c4b0f1bc59d0dd60ac
msgid "**Mission Execution**:"
msgstr "**任务执行**："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:125
#: d6f8b1cfdc12486a8ad0f0e191194ec6
msgid "The node attempts to arm the plane and switch to takeoff mode."
msgstr "节点尝试解锁飞机并切换到起飞模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:126
#: 9f3a177c669141adb375e613fb8808a0
msgid ""
"Once the plane reaches the takeoff altitude, it switches to guided mode."
msgstr "飞机到达起飞高度后，切换到引导模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:127
#: 168bf67a9fa549a39c608bc34997137f
msgid ""
"The node sends a goal position for the plane to reach using guided control."
msgstr "节点使用引导控制发送目标位置，引导飞机前往。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-waypoint-goal-interface.rst:128
#: 4e8f690ca99546858e7ec87412ea4922
msgid ""
"The `achieved_goal(goal_global_pos, cur_geopose)` function checks if the "
"plane has reached the goal."
msgstr "`achieved_goal(goal_global_pos, cur_geopose)` 函数检查飞机是否已到达目标位置。"

